Import individual logos from `logo-set`, or browse the full set with `LogoGallery`.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import ThreePortals from '~/components/logos/logo-set/three-portals.svelte';
	import Apple from '~/components/logos/logo-set/apple.svelte';
	import Google from '~/components/logos/logo-set/google.svelte';
</script>

<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
	<ThreePortals class="h-10 w-auto" />
	<Apple class="size-6" />
	<Google class="size-6" />
</div>
```
